# Cursor Editor — Production Documentation

> _Complete reference for the Cursor AI Editor system — architecture, agent hierarchy, skills, rules, SDK, MCP integration, canvas system, settings, and standard operating procedures._

## Purpose

This documentation set provides a single source of truth for understanding, operating, and extending the Cursor AI Editor. It covers the full system stack from the editor core through the agent engine, skills system, rules system, MCP integration, SDK layer, and Canvas artifacts.

